    "brandSprint": {
      "id": 768,
      "collection": "roadmap",
      "slug": "brand-sprint",
      "title": "Brand sprint — 4 days",
      "status": null,
      "body": "# Brand & marketing sprint — 4 days (19–22 Jun 2026)\n\n**Goal:** Complete a founder-approved brand + marketing plan Denis can execute against.  \n**Owner:** Denis (decisions) · Agents (drafts, research, HQ updates)  \n**HQ:** Open **Brand sprint** tab for daily focus, copy-paste Slack replies, and resources.\n\n---\n\n## Why now\n\n- PO listing live + interviews → need consistent story for candidates and leads\n- Empty Facebook page → need channel strategy before posting\n- Consultant vs full-time PO vs hybrid ops → affects how brand shows up day-to-day\n- SoftUni owns “vibe coding for beginners / no-code” — we must own a **different wedge**\n\n---\n\n## Sprint schedule\n\n| Day | Date | Focus | Denis output (Slack) |\n|-----|------|-------|----------------------|\n| **1** | Thu 19 Jun | Positioning & secret sauce | `brand day1: …` |\n| **2** | Fri 20 Jun | Identity — how you appear | `brand day2: …` |\n| **3** | Sat 21 Jun | Channels & content rhythm | `brand day3: …` |\n| **4** | Sun 22 Jun | Budget + 90-day marketing calendar | `brand day4: …` |\n\nAfter day 4: agent merges answers into `planning/brand-marketing-plan-draft-2026-06-19.md` + `business/plan` sections in hq.db.\n\n---\n\n## Day 1 — Positioning & secret sauce\n\n**Read first:** `research/2026-06-19-brand-positioning-secret-sauce.md`\n\n**Denis tasks (60–90 min)**\n\n1. Pick **primary ICP** (one sentence): e.g. “Mid-level BG devs already using Cursor who want a shipped capstone + automation pack”\n2. Write **anti-audience** (who we turn away): e.g. “Career switchers with zero coding”\n3. Confirm or edit **secret sauce** draft (3 bullets max)\n4. Choose **PO / ops model** for next 90 days: full-time PO | consultant | hybrid (you + part-time)\n\n**Copy-paste reply**\n\n```\nbrand day1: ICP=[…] — NOT for=[…] — secret sauce=[bullet1; bullet2; bullet3] — ops=[full-time PO | consultant | hybrid]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Day 2 — Brand identity (how you appear)\n\n**Read first:** `content/brand/creative-brief.md`\n\n**Denis tasks (45–60 min)**\n\n1. Pick **visual direction** (A / B / C in creative brief) or paste references\n2. Confirm **one-liner** (BG + EN if needed) — current: “Стани част от AI революцията”\n3. Pick **primary CTA** for next 30 days: waitlist | LinkedIn DM | info session\n4. Approve or edit **tone** (practitioner / no hype — see brand-voice rule)\n\n**Copy-paste reply**\n\n```\nbrand day2: visual=[A|B|C|custom URL] — one-liner=[…] — CTA=[waitlist|LinkedIn|info session] — tone OK=[yes|edits: …]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Day 3 — Channels & content rhythm\n\n**Denis tasks (45–60 min)**\n\n1. Rank channels for **first 90 days** (1 = most effort): LinkedIn, Facebook, X, YouTube, local meetups, paid ads\n2. **Facebook page** — purpose: community hub | event announcements | repost LinkedIn | skip for now\n3. **Content rhythm** — pick one: 2×/week LinkedIn + 1×/month live | 3×/week short posts | minimal until cohort date set\n4. **Path:** deck-first | landing-first | hybrid (from `planning/landing-vs-deck-decision-brief.md`)\n\n**Copy-paste reply**\n\n```\nbrand day3: channels=[LI=#, FB=#, X=#, …] — facebook=[hub|events|repost|skip] — rhythm=[…] — path=[deck|landing|hybrid]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Day 4 — Budget & 90-day calendar\n\n**Read first:** budget scenarios table in HQ Brand sprint tab\n\n**Denis tasks (60 min)**\n\n1. Pick **budget tier**: lean (€500–1.5k/mo) | medium (€1.5–4k) | aggressive (€4k+) for months 1–3\n2. Approve **early bird placeholder** or defer: price range, seats, target month (no public claim until legal line OK)\n3. Sign off **week 1–4 marketing actions** (agent draft in plan doc)\n4. Final: `brand plan approved` or list edits\n\n**Copy-paste reply**\n\n```\nbrand day4: budget=[lean|medium|aggressive] — early bird=[defer | €X / N seats / month] — plan=[approved | edits: …]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Resources (prep reading)\n\n| Resource | Why |\n|----------|-----|\n| [SoftUni Vibe Coding program](https://ai.softuni.bg/application-vibe-coding) | See what “vibe coding” means in BG market — **no-code / beginners** |\n| [Telerik — Marketing budgets sprint](https://www.telerikacademy.com/sprint/marketing-budgets-that-drive-growth) | Budget allocation framework (BG-priced) |\n| `research/2026-05-27-bulgaria-ai-coding-market` | Competitor map in hq.db |\n| `planning/landing-vs-deck-decision-brief.md` | Deck vs landing tradeoffs |\n| `content/presentation/outline.md` | Existing narrative spine |\n| [Google Ads BG training case study](https://www.adwaycreative.bg/arlet-k-professional-training-center-case-study-google-ads-strategy/) | Local CPA benchmarks (~€3–6 per inquiry) |\n| *Obviously Awesome* (April Dunford) | Positioning workbook — 1-hour skim of “context + differentiation” |\n| [Indie Hackers — audience building](https://www.indiehackers.com/) | Practitioner-led brand examples |\n\n---\n\n## Agent follow-up after sprint\n\n1. Merge Denis replies → `planning/brand-marketing-plan-draft-2026-06-19.md`\n2. Update `business/plan-*` sections in hq.db\n3. Unlock social drafts + FB page copy aligned to chosen CTA\n4. PO/consultant decision → update hiring comms in careers draft\n",
      "props": {
        "sprint_start": "2026-06-19",
